    "text": "WJFW-TV\nwebsite\nForest County, Wisconsin\nBlackwell Job Corps students, employees facing uncertain future amid federal pause\n3 hours ago\nIn Forest County, a federal program helps young adults gain the career skills they need to make a life in the trades after graduation. But federal budget cuts are putting the program at risk. “I would not have the hope I have for my future if not for this place,” said Robyn Williams, Blackwell Job Corps student.",
